  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Defines a named value that a <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.ShellContent" /> supplies to its page through Shell query parameter handling.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            Parameter names are case-sensitive. When a <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.ShellContent" /> contains duplicate names, the last parameter
            in the collection supplies the value. A navigation parameter supplied to <c>GoToAsync</c> takes precedence for
            that navigation; selecting the content again reapplies its declarative parameters. Instances are logical children
            of their owning <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.ShellContent" /> and cannot be shared across different owners.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
